    "q-351197": {
      "dom_id": "step-q351197",
      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Find the Cartesian equation $y=f(x)$ of the tangent line to the polar curve $r={e}^{-\\theta }$ at $\\theta =0,$ given that \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }.\n$$\n\nThe Cartesian equation of the tangent line is $y=$\n{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "To find the equation of the tangent line to a polar curve at a point $P,$ we follow four steps:\n\n**Step 1**: Calculate the derivative $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}:$\n\nIn this case, we're given that\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta -\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }.\n$$\n\n**Step 2**: Find the slope of the tangent at $P:$\n\nThe slope of the tangent line is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m & ={\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}|}_{\\theta =0} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡0-\\operatorname{cos}⁡0}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡0+\\operatorname{sin}⁡0} \\\\  & =\\frac{0-1}{1+0} \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 3**: Find the Cartesian coordinates of $P:$\n\nWe compute the $xy$-coordinates of $P$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} & =r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={e}^{-\\theta }\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={e}^{0}\\operatorname{cos}⁡0 \\\\  & =1\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =1 \\\\ {y}_{1} & =r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={e}^{-\\theta }\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & ={e}^{0}\\operatorname{sin}⁡0 \\\\  & =1\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of $P$ are $(1,0).$\n\n**Step 4**: Using point-slope form, find the equation of the tangent:\n\nWe find the equation of the tangent as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y-{y}_{1} & =m(x-{x}_{1}) \\\\ y-0 & =-1(x-1) \\\\ y & =-x+1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14225095/assets/6651277bec90a77e19d0bd6c1d1a464f636cf675cae25ad47a6f60a2a352002b.png)",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
